{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45490","headline":"寄乾陵杨侍郎 · 子兰","name":"寄乾陵杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷落官资不畏贫，司曹且共内官分。\n步量野色成公案，点检樵声入奏闻。\n陵庙路因朝去扫，御炉香每夜来焚。\n碑寒树古神门上，管得无穷空白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"子兰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}